Package: libleancrypto1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Post-quantum-resistant cryptographic library
 Leancrypto is a cryptographic library that exclusively contains
 post-quantum-cryptography (PQC) resistant algorithms. It supports
 ML-KEM (Kyber), ML-DSA (Dilithium), SLH-DSA (SPHINCS+), BIKE, HQC,
 and classical algorithms including AES, SHA-2, SHA-3, ChaCha20, HMAC,
 KMAC, and various KDFs and DRNGs.
 .
 The library is designed with minimal POSIX dependencies, is fully
 thread-safe, supports stack-only allocation, and provides side-channel
 resistant implementations.

Package: libleancrypto-fips1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libleancrypto1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Post-quantum-resistant cryptographic library — FIPS 140 variant
 Leancrypto is a cryptographic library that exclusively contains
 post-quantum-cryptography (PQC) resistant algorithms.
 .
 This package contains the FIPS 140 compliant variant of the leancrypto
 shared library (libleancrypto-fips.so.1). It includes a runtime integrity
 check of the shared library binary to comply with FIPS 140 requirements.

Package: libleancrypto-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libleancrypto1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libleancrypto-fips1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for the leancrypto library
 Leancrypto is a cryptographic library that exclusively contains
 post-quantum-cryptography (PQC) resistant algorithms.
 .
 This package contains the header files, pkg-config files, unversioned
 shared library symlinks, and static libraries needed to build applications
 against leancrypto.

Package: leancrypto-tools
Section: utils
Architecture: any
Depends: libleancrypto1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Utility tools provided by the leancrypto library
 Leancrypto is a cryptographic library that exclusively contains
 post-quantum-cryptography (PQC) resistant algorithms.
 .
 This package contains utility applications built on leancrypto:
  - sha256sum, sha384sum, sha512sum: SHA-2 hash utilities
  - sha3-256sum, sha3-384sum, sha3-512sum: SHA-3 hash utilities
  - ascon256-sum: Ascon-256 hash utility
  - lc_x509_generator: X.509 certificate generator
  - lc_pkcs7_generator: PKCS#7 message generator
 .
 The hash utilities serve as drop-in replacements for the standard
 coreutils sha*sum tools, installed under /usr/libexec/leancrypto/.

